---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import ResourcePageLayout from "../../../layouts/ResourcePageLayout.astro";
---

<ResourcePageLayout
  title="Twentyone.world"
  description="Twentyone.world — a global network of Bitcoin communities and resources."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="hero-image">
    <Image src="/images/content/twentyoneworld.png" alt="Twentyone.world – overview of forks" width={2048} height={1251} />
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <p><strong>Twentyone.world</strong> is a network of open communities focused on localized, high-quality, Bitcoin-only content. Each community offers an open space for Bitcoin enthusiasts in their respective countries to connect, collaborate, and exchange ideas.</p>

    <p>In the graphic above, you can see existing forks. <strong>If you have a Bitcoin friend in a country where there isn't already a similar initiative, you can tell them about Twentyone.world.</strong></p>

    <p>The project grew out of <a href="https://einundzwanzig.space/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">EINUNDZWANZIG</a>, which is ENOGTYVE in Germany, and more. Twentyone.world is one of many initiatives by Gigi — see <a href="https://www.dergigi.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dergigi.com</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <a href="https://www.twentyone.world" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-card">
      <span class="cta-icon">🌍</span>
      <div class="cta-content">
        <span class="cta-name">Twentyone.world</span>
        <span class="cta-desc">Visit Twentyone.world and find your local community</span>
      </div>
      <span class="cta-arrow">→</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <a href="#" class="back-to-top"> ↑ Back to top </a>
</ResourcePageLayout>

<style>
  .hero-image {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.12);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .content-section p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .cta-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.04);
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.5);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cta-icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cta-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .cta-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .cta-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(204, 204, 204, 0.6);
  }

  .cta-arrow {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    opacity: 0.5;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-card:hover .cta-arrow {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 567px) {
    .cta-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-arrow {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
